   "LastUpdated": "2026-08-11",
   "ResearcherNotesUnit": "GC, Aug 2026: I'm moving this to shelved with a Q1 2025 date, as there's been no news since Suriname's president and the Port of Rotterdam issued statements in Jan and Feb 2025, respectively, indicating that the Firebird project and associated Nickerie deep sea port would not be moving forward.  An October 2025 article in Fortune Magazine referred to Firebird LNG as a \"stalled\" project whose owners had resorted to selling off equipment to Texas-based Fermi LLC (a sale confirmed separately in the SEC filing below):\nhttps://fortune.com/2025/10/10/rick-perry-ai-power-startup-fermi-ipo-zero-revenue/\nhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2071778/000121390025085175/ea025233301ex10-11_fermi.htm\nThe project seems to have been plagued with uncertainty for quite a while before 2025, based on this September 2023 interview, which says that Staatsolie was not willing to move ahead with the project unless Phoenix could answer three key questions:\n1) Where will the gas come from?\n2)Who will buy the LNG/gas?\n3)Does Phoenix actually have a preliminary design?\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iiPgyw3qyLU\nhttps://surinamenieuwscentrale.com/direkteur-staatsolie-over-controverse-rond-phoenix-development-i-sun-web-tv-i\n\nAL2025: After Port of Rotterdam Authority announced it wouldn't be participating in the project after having submitted an action plan, a few sources have speculated that the project is not getting off the ground (\"Port of Nickerie struggling to get off the ground: Delays and Doubts about Realization\"). Van Oord also stepped down, according to some sources. However, NV Havenbeheer director still claims project is moving ahead. Might be shelved, but since there have been mentions of the project in 2025, I'm leaving it as proposed. GC, Sep 2024: This project still appears to be in the pre-FID stage, with a projected FID date of 2024. Once FID has been made, the developers estimate that it will take 28 months to build.",
   "ResearcherNotesProject": "Gregor, Aug 2026: Project appears to have been shelved as of early 2025. See Unit Notes below.",
